sequenceDiagram
  actor St as Student
  participant HD as Help Desk
  participant RAG as RAG (public only)
  participant TR as Triage
  participant Q as Staff queue
  actor Fa as Faculty
  St->>HD: Ask question
  HD->>RAG: retrieve(public_only)
  RAG-->>St: Cited answer from public knowledge
  St->>HD: Not answered, raise ticket
  HD->>TR: classify(subject, description)
  TR-->>Q: category, priority, office (LLM, keyword fallback)
  TR->>RAG: draft reply (staff scope)
  RAG-->>Q: AI draft + sources (staff only)
  Fa->>Q: Review, edit, send
  Q-->>St: Human-written reply
